<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA V INDIA FINAL TEST SCOREBOARD.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA V INDIA FINAL TEST SCOREBOARD.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard on the first day of the third and final test between South Africa and India at the Wanderers on Thursday.</p>
<p>India first innings</p>
<p> V.Rathore c Richardson b Adams	   13</p>
<p> N.Mongia b Donald			    21</p>
<p> R.Dravid not out			     81</p>
<p> S.Tendulkar c McMillan b Cronje	  35</p>
<p> S.Ganguly not out			    68</p>
<p> Extras (lb-4 nb-7 w-4)		     15</p>
<p> Total (for three wickets, 90 overs)   233</p>
<p>Fall of wickets: 1-25 2-46 3-100</p>
<p>To bat: M.Azharuddin, V.Laxman, A.Kumble, J.Srinath, D.Ganesh, V.Prasad.</p>
<p>Bowling: Donald 18.1-6-44-1 (w2), Pollock 19-7-38-0 (nb5), McMillan 14.5-4-34-0, Klusener 16-4-47-0 (nb2 w2), Adams 14-4-47-1, Cronje 8-4-19-1</p>
<p>South Africa -G.Kirsten, A.Hudson, A.Bacher, D.Cullinan, H.Cronje, B.McMillan, S.Pollock, D.Richardson, L.Klusener, A.Donald, P.Adams.</p>
